# D3-LI-002: A plant indicator can trace an acid-base round trip
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
add v1 water 50mL
add v1 anthocyanin 0.001g
measure v1 ph
measure v1 uvvis
add v1 HCl 0.0001mol
measure v1 ph
measure v1 uvvis
add v1 NaOH 0.0001mol
measure v1 ph
measure v1 uvvis
inspect
